<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97757" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατοικ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>colonize jointly, join in colonizing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Σάμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.149
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.4
			</span></i>; <i>restore jointly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λεοντίνους</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινά τινι</span>
			<i>settle</i> or <i>plant</i> in a place <i>along with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταῖς ς. δάκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					646
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>establish jointly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνημεῖα κακῶν τε κἀγαθῶν ἀΐδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς λογισμοῖς ἔρωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					7.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
